    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c720217d755ea053614fe05",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先得赢下这场比赛，\n让大家安心才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d35402094e0e62f2d746ee3c83255087fc641e57b56c6659a7ab87af20dcb481",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef19fd35ccdf12722967d99e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就如同她所说的，小栗帽在直线\n突破重围获得压倒性胜利，\n在家乡的人们面前展现了实力的差距！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b52618a2ab8d5966c093be774779725210221bb4f5acc13ff2e47c3d2dc922da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc6a1d5d67438a46d8b7ab2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我往吃惊的小栗帽所看的方向望过去，\n看到一群闹哄哄的人\n开心地往这里挥着手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e2831bbe6b6e808e449a1167b1f021c1dec1ca19766d6ef4921e1542ded5b0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c6aa280dd13abd83d6ad5ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "阿茂",
      "source_fingerprint": "41b5e0cc30998494fb6391d03edb339589b28070e8f31eb0ea826e4f2c96a3f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006113.json",
