      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看见她逞强的样子让我有点担心，\n不过毕竟是小栗帽的意愿，\n所以我接受了所有采访……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7abdf3b4de8f0ce3ceb124e6217de2ab1ea0ea3e741d66c0fa8e8f4e7d3dcc26",
