    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0762160b21834b08380062de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为行程上的关系，\n小栗帽连续接受采访。\n即使她显露疲态，目前为止也很顺利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7d49bef77dcc78e26431395921e9714ebd6e90a32f73892284761d73d4ee495",
